        "headline": {
          "en": "Sultai Lotus Scapeshift",
          "zh": "苏勒台变境"
        },
        "order": 1,
        "positioning": {
          "en": "This Sultai Scapeshift build won this week's 98-player RCQ. It plays the full four copies of Badgermole Cub and runs Stock Up in the main deck, with Dread Presence and Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth serving as the payoff for its infinite landfall loop. Its sideboard sweeper is Vicious Rivalry from SOS instead of the traditional Wither or Culling Ritual.",
          "zh": "本周席卷98人RCQ的苏勒台变境。是满编獾地鼠幼兽并主牌就带囤积物资的版本，还带了颤栗鬼影和约格莫夫之墓乌尔博格作为无限地落出口。备牌的扫场选择了SOS的额度对抗而不是传统的衰萎或者牲祭仪式。"
        },
